# Throwaway verification scripts. They must live here rather than in a temp dir so that
# `import { chromium } from 'playwright'` resolves against this project's node_modules, which is
# exactly why they keep getting staged by accident (twice on 2026-09-22/23).
scripts/tmp-*

# 介紹用截圖（2026-10-04），不進版控
screenshots/

# check-a11y-pages.mjs 的報告（認證用的那一份複製到 docs/a11y/evidence/）
a11y-report/

# PageSpeed Insights 的完整報告（scripts/lighthouse-check.mjs）：大、只留本機，摘要送業務中台
lighthouse-report/
